--- !u!114 &1093987812
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1093987809}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b8cdaafff41ca46f8b1804b1796bc1ee, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textComponent: {fileID: 554266125}
  lines:
  - 'Creature: Well, well, well! If it isn''t the being that resurected me!'
  - 'Creature: Based on your expression, I guess you had no idea those keys you used
    were what brought me back to life.'
  - 'Creature: You see, those "keys" were used to unlock the levels of the maze and
    this maze system is my lifeforce.'
  - 'Creature: You essentially revived me by using those "keys", or should I say
    organs.'
  - 'Creature: It has been too long since I have been able to move freely. I am grateful
    for your obliviousness.'
  - 'Creature: Despite my appreciation, I must now kill you and reclaim my home.
    I just hope you don''t have my weakness with you.'
  textSpeed: 0.08
